    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Marauder · уровень 18</b></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you may spend one use of your<br>Second Wind to command your allies to focus their assault on a single foe. Choose one creature you can see.<br>Each ally within 30 feet of you who can hear you can use its Reaction to move up to half its Speed and make one attack against the chosen target.<br>A marauder is not born in glory, but in the small fights no one remembers, where survival is the only victory.<br>—Anton Flame-born</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Союзники сами тратят реакции и выполняют движение/атаку.</li></ul>"
